// Fragment file imported inline inside a `service` block in main.wcl.
// The importing block's `Service` schema covers `region` and `tier`,
// so they're validated when this file is imported. Running
// `wcl check` on this file *standalone* will report
// `NoDocumentSchema` for the bare fields — by design, a fragment
// like this isn't meant to be checked on its own.
region = "us-east-1"
tier   = :gold
